  "description": "NVIDIA Nemotron 3.5 ASR streaming (0.6B, int4 ONNX, multilingual encoder with\n      English locale selection) speech-to-text model for DemaConsulting.Speech, run directly\n      through ONNX Runtime with no bundled native inference engine (unlike\n      DemaConsulting.Speech.Sherpa's sherpa-onnx-backed models). This package owns the full\n      streaming recognition pipeline for this one model family itself - log-mel feature\n      extraction, cache-aware streaming encoder inference, RNN-T greedy decoding, detokenization,\n      and leading-silence mitigation - installed into a SpeechModelCatalog via the\n      AddNemotronSttModels() extension method. Reference this package alongside\n      DemaConsulting.Speech to get this model out of the box; core DemaConsulting.Speech itself\n      ships with zero built-in models and has no dependency on ONNX Runtime.",
  "iconFile": "Icon.png",
